      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '

    1 Seeing that the owner of this book found the game redundant, God
    created tarot cards.

    2 And God allowed him to draw a tarot card each time
    he won a trick.

    2 And each tarot card had its own rule, visible directly
    on that card.

    3 And God said, "These rules prevail over all other rules",
    4 and will apply to all players for the entire trick

    5 God is merciful.
    Thus, he allowed those unable to apply the rule to ignore it.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 015c0429fd5bc614ca92018035019cd5, type: 2}
