  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '

    1 In the beginning, God created the trick, consisting of three cards
    (one played by each player) and representing a round of play.

    2 And the
    trick could only be won by the player who played the highest card of the suit
    led, or the highest card of the trump suit. 3 And the trump suit was always the
    strongest one.

    4 And God said, "Let there be trumps" : and the trump suit
    appeared on the left side, next to the red deck, for the entire game (13 tricks).

    5
    And God saw the players, that they were competing : and God divided the first
    to play from the others.

    6 God allowed the first player to play whatever
    he wanted, and forced the others to follow suit (if they could). 7 If they couldn''t,
    God said they can choose to cut using a trump card or to play any other card.

    8
    And God gave the player two choices: to achieve the required number of tricks
    or to achieve none at all.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 015c0429fd5bc614ca92018035019cd5, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -4529764207281494284, guid: 015c0429fd5bc614ca92018035019cd5, type: 2}
